              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 25:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nawe, mukuku wanje, uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Rāba, ngira nce urubanza hagati y’ibitungwa n’ibindi, hagati y’impfizi z’intama n’iz’ impene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega muvyita icoroshe, iyo murishije umugutu mwiza, uwo mwāri mushigaje mukawutakangisha inzāra? Cank’ iyo mushōtse amazi y’umusarara, ayo mwāri mushigaje mukayaca iyondoyondo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ intama zanje zo, zisigaye zirya ivy’ inzāra zanyu zātakanze, zigashōka ay’ inzāra zanyu zāciye iyondoyondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.34.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
